{"id":"ratschlag","lemma":"Ratschlag","pos":"noun","rank":4234,"glosses":["piece of advice; (in plural) advice"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c5/De-Ratschlag.ogg/De-Ratschlag.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Ratschlages","plural":"Ratschläge"},"examples":[{"text":"Vielen Dank für die Ratschläge.","en":"Thanks a lot for the advice.","words":[null,null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"thank you very much"]]},{"text":"Ich werde ihm einen Ratschlag geben.","en":"I'll give him a piece of advice.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to give"}]},{"text":"Ich brauche deine Ratschläge nicht.","en":"I don't need your advice.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Lass mich dir einen Ratschlag geben.","en":"Let me give you a bit of advice.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to give"}]},{"text":"Er hat mir kaum Ratschläge gegeben.","en":"He didn't give me much advice.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"barely, hardly"},null,{"g":"given"}]}]}